Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.76,0:00:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't Avdol's flames supposed\Nto be able to sense anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.31,0:00:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has been reduced to nothingness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were arrogant enough to\Nbelieve you could defeat Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to demonstrate\Njust how wrong you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will fall in line, one by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as I scatter your atomic fragments\Nacross the recesses of the Void.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.06,0:00:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol's not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.62,0:00:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.14,0:00:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have\Nimagined Polareth's stand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:00:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could attack this\Nswiftly from so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An amazing feat to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to look at me when I kill you!
