Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.47,0:01:21.31,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.34,0:01:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming to the end of the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:02:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to hit the video of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.28,0:02:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the beginning of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to continue to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to continue to go. Crusaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.70,0:02:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last page of the last page.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TATAKIKKOMEEND?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the world, Sonochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NO Kong.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.02,0:02:52.19,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,689)\pos(135,858)}Episode 43: The Miasma of the Void, Cool Ice, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.84,0:02:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, now I'm sure\Nsomething fishy's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.58,0:02:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since we escaped the Mirage,\NI've heard the sounds of a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:02:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.86,0:02:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol and Polnareff are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.38,0:03:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I hit the bastard, but\Nit wasn't enough to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just swallowed himself again\Nso he could hide in that abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn that guy in his stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol, how could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you break the one\Nrule you gave us? Pull the ref!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy, you have to get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You told us we had to watch our own backs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you wouldn't save us\Neven if we were in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.84,0:03:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been meddling in\Nother people's business
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever since the moment\Nwe set foot in India!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you just leave me alone\Nand mind your own freaking business?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't ducked, I'd\Nbe a dead man right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:04:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like fate is telling me to carry on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be Avdol's way of\Nknocking some sense into me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's way too dangerous in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.70,0:04:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get moving!
