Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to make it upstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't fall behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up ahead! It's the exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I won't just turn tail and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol sacrificed himself for us, and\NI'll repay that debt no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:05:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He believed we had the power to\Nput an end to Dio once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't betray his faith\Nin us by letting him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not an option!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to take the easy way\Nout like some common coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna see this fight\Nthrough to the bitter end!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only place I'm running\Nto is Dio's shadow den!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.52,0:05:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So up the stairs we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.28,0:05:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expected him to dash out the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive, he managed a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems Polnareff's mental\Nfortitude gives him the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ability to conquer his fears\Nin the face of imminent death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will soon be joining\NAvdol, rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:06:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your strength pales in comparison to\Nthe harbinger of death that is my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If what he says is true, his stand's jaws\Nare the gateway to an alternate dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dark, unimaginable abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that allows him to move through our\Nrealm without leaving any trace of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how does he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how the heck am I\Nsupposed to beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.08,0:06:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's cut us off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's nearby!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy, I need you to watch my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, I'll do the same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:06:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.81,0:07:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if he wants to reach us, then he's going\Nto have to come out of that other realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.74,0:07:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has to come out from the\Ndark beyond at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.66,0:07:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he does, I'll take my chance and\Nattack him with everything I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.06,0:07:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, come at me,\Nyou demented pinball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll slice you in two!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I pissed off so my\Nchariot's even faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may have lost Avdol, but it'll be a cold\Nday in hell before I let you get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?! He was hiding under my foot!
