Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My foot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got your foot so that\Nyou can't hide anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, a brawl's underway!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol and Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they came in after us and\Nwound up getting themselves into a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find them ASAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've managed to hide\Namid the chaos, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have gone\Nfar with that injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means you're hiding\Nbeneath the rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.54,0:08:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now you must have realized\Nyou're helpless against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shall meet your end by my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, where could you be, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.70,0:09:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite the ruckus, Vanilla Ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be careful, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe Polnareff and that four-legged\Nrudin are still hiding nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to handle the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mustn't trouble yourself\Nwith such nonsense, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fake deal made from the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.60,0:09:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd think I'd feel guilty about\Nattacking from behind like a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you'd be wrong, because you\Npulled the same shit on Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:09:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the death you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:09:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Iggy, crucify him!
