Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make him pay for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End his life in the same\Nmerciless way he did Avdol's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send him straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, he knows,\Nbut how? Because the windows
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to my left are letting in\Nthe light from the sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord deal would never enter\Nthis room during the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll suffer a thousand deaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for your deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a vow to Lord Dio that\NI would kill you, interlopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He entrusted me with that honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio's a man of his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would never descend to the\Nsecond floor for any reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's gonna kill Iggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's about to be swallowed by the abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die, you filthy, pathetic dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your incorrigible ruse forced me\Nto destroy Lord Dio's likeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he really just hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't use the void!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of killing Iggy,\Nhe went in for a punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if it was a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.06,0:11:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You forced me to destroy a\Nfigure in the form of Lord Dio,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you must answer for that crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life is mine now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will kick you to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dark abyss could swallow\Nyou whole in an instant,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a quick death\Nwouldn't satiate my fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole mess, it's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what happens\Nto those who anger me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you learned your lesson yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about it? Is this better?\NTell me! Is it? Is it? Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like Cool Ice's brain has melted!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he really going batshit\Nbecause he destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some pile of sand that looked like Dio?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From over here, his\Nsoul is the murky abyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bottomless black\Nhole that obliterates
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.24,0:12:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any and everything that gets in its way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was warned about the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio said the Resolve in their\Nhearts must never be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you, you're just a flea bitten stray.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never known Resolve, and you\Ncertainly know nothing of pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't grin at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone! You like that? Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, your suffering's just begun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.98,0:12:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool Ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.18,0:13:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dealing with me now!
