Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ending this, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, Iggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our plan to trick Cool Ice\Nmay have fallen through,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your sand might have just saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I think I found\Na way to find the bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see him moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess your stand power\Nis a double-edged sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you move, your stand has no choice\Nbut to absorb everything in your path.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So choke on a mouthful of this and\Nget over here, you piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.20,0:14:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as you come out from behind\Nyour stand's putrid teeth to attack me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.66,0:14:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll turn the tables and finish you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bullseye, yeah! Eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, would you look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found your weakness, Cool Ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any attempt to pinpoint my\Nlocation leaves you vulnerable,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is probably a tad\Ninconvenient since you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.64,0:14:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see me without emerging\Nfrom your dark dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now suck on my sword and\Nburn in hell, field de putt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I skewed your throat and brain stem!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you die already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way you're getting out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and die! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop making me repeat myself! Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:14:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mission is far too\Nimportant to feel any pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not rest until I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll swallow Iggy, the Joestars,\Nand anyone else who gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only after your deaths\Nwill I allow myself to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew to withdraw your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also know that you're about to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.26,0:15:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vile arm you used to stab me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.28,0:15:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to shove him away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go now?
