Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:15:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got my leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't think about\Nthe pain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so close, I almost\Nmanaged to land a killing blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he got away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is different,\Nfueled by pure vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.22,0:16:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's not just nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His devotion to Dio is all-consuming,\Nbut I won't let him get the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you couldn't die yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't die until I kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.20,0:16:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit! It's no use!
