Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand just obliterated\Nthe tip of my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.44,0:16:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it probably wouldn't\Nmatter even if it were intact!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to attack him\Nwhen he's hidden in the abyss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I so much as touch that\Nthing, it'll swallow me whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.37,0:16:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's absorbing the\Nbuilding at random! Mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.96,0:16:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows full well I'll go\Nafter him if he shows himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he's blindly attacking to\Nprevent me from fighting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.14,0:17:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he's going\Nto hit me for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.44,0:17:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should pull back Chariot\Nand think of a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn this isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not gonna last long if he keeps\Nlosing blood from the state he's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say his broken ribs\Nmust have punctured his
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.72,0:17:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lungs
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just when I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thought this couldn't get
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is he devouring the walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think I was all
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't random.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was all part of his\Nplan from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been drawing circles
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with every lap, he's\Ngetting closer and closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The odds are stacked against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:17:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He still doesn't know our location.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with that rolling ball\Nof death hurtling toward us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got us right where he wants us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm gonna be able to dodge\Nan attack from him with this bum leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta try to escape\Nthrough the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.46,0:18:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough\Ntime to tunnel through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming straight for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow I dodged it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not out of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.10,0:18:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's closing in on me like a\Nneedle on an old record player!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only have about five\Nmore rounds before he makes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his way back here and\Nfinishes me off for good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, the million-dollar question is,\Nhow do I dodge with this injured leg?
