Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They only entered the mansion\Nten minutes before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As much as I'd love for\Nthem to swoop in out of thin
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.32,0:19:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,air and save the day like\Nsome American comic book hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wishful thinking's not gonna save me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.94,0:19:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point hoping for\Nan out-of-the-blue rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all I know, the others might be\Nin the middle of a fight themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Option one's our only choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Chariot, I need you to pull me\Nout of the circle as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull me faster, Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.14,0:19:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
