Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life's a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.14,0:20:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silver Chariot is a finesse-oriented\Nstand that fights with a saber.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It simply doesn't have the\Npower to pull my body weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.40,0:20:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially when I'm injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're holding on by a thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay down, you stupid mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.84,0:20:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep moving or try\Nusing your stance power,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your broken ribs will sink deeper\Ninto your lungs and kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.86,0:20:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you can drop the\Ntough guy act you idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only thing this will\Naccomplish is you dying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.00,0:20:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right along with me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.06,0:20:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just you wait
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.20,0:20:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm the one
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who's gonna save you you\Nhave to live on to tell Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.86,0:21:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar and the others about this bastard\Nyou have to defeat him in my stead?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol might have saved me, but\Nyou sure as hell better not!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we all die here, then\Nwhat was the point of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more loop, and it's lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.32,0:21:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's number three.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life can be a bitch sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We both wanted to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess he wanted it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Au River, Iggy. Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.26,0:23:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood that stings my body is Avdol's.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.50,0:23:28.51,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.16,0:23:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,handiwork I'm not privy\Nto all of the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.85,0:23:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had some pretty selfless friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.74,0:23:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.88,0:23:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how it always is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it until after they're gone.
